    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Team Paul Reddy are delighted to bring No. 42 Ridgewood Square to the market, a beautifully maintained two-bedroom, two-bathroom end-of-terrace home. This attractive property benefits from gas-fired central heating, double-glazed windows throughout, a private west-facing patio and a superb setting overlooking landscaped green areas to both the front and rear. Ideally positioned within the highly sought-after Ridgewood development, the property is presented in excellent condition and ready for immediate occupation.\r\n\r\nA welcoming entrance hallway with guest W.C. leads to a spacious front living room overlooking the green area to the front and featuring an attractive gas fire fireplace, creating a warm and inviting focal point. To the rear, the open-plan kitchen and dining area enjoy views over the private patio and provide an ideal space for everyday family living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are two generously proportioned double bedrooms, both benefiting from excellent built-in wardrobe storage and the main bathroom.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property enjoys a superb position overlooking a landscaped green area, creating a wonderful sense of space and openness. To the rear, a fully paved private patio provides a low-maintenance outdoor retreat, perfect for outdoor dining and relaxing. Residents also enjoy access to beautifully maintained communal green spaces throughout the development.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from one designated parking space together with ample visitor parking and additional free parking available within the adjoining cul-de-sac.\r\n\r\nRidgewood is an award-winning residential development renowned for its family-friendly environment and excellent amenities. The property is conveniently located within walking distance of shops, schools, crèches, playgrounds, sports facilities and Ridgewood Playing Pitches.\r\n\r\nSwords Village and The Pavilions Shopping Centre are approximately a 10-minute walk away, offering an extensive range of shops, cafés, restaurants and leisure facilities. The area is exceptionally well served by public transport, including the Swords Express service, providing a direct journey to Dublin City Centre in approximately 15 minutes. Airside Retail Park, Dublin Airport, the M1 and M50 motorways are all within easy reach, making it an ideal location for commuters and families alike.\r\n\r\nNo. 42 Ridgewood Square combines comfortable modern living, a superb location and excellent convenience, making it a truly outstanding home in one of Swords' most desirable residential developments."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR: \r\nHall\t                                   \r\n0.96 x 0.84m      \r\nLaminate wood flooring\r\n\r\nLiving Room                      \r\n5.80 x 4.00m      \r\nLaminate wood flooring, featuring gas fire fireplace.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining                 \r\n4.00 x 3.53m      \r\nOpen-plan kitchen/dining. Fully fitted units, tiled splashback, laminate wood flooring. Door to patio. \r\n\r\nGuest WC                          \r\n0.75 x 1.57m      \r\nWC & WHB\r\n\r\nTerrace                                \r\nTiled \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR: \r\nLanding              \r\n3.36 x 1.94m \t  \r\nCarpeted flooring \r\n\r\nBedroom 1       \r\n4.00 x 3.21m       \r\nCarpeted flooring, built-in wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 2        \r\n4.00 x 3.10m \t  \r\nCarpeted flooring, built-in wardrobe\r\n\r\nBathroom          \r\n3.94 x 1.95m       \r\nBath, WHB, WC, fully tiled.\r\n\r\n\r\nNote: Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs are provided for guidance only."
